                                        "entry_id": "a1d1bee6-f62a-3736-97e4-e56db2efc9e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Kochtopf, der durch Überdruck die Garzeit verringert"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d231406c-fe53-4030-a635-1608a4bacba6",
                                                "sense_id": "28aaf6a3-6f61-352d-a741-3cb65fa916a3",
                                                "text": "Um den Dampfdruck zu erreichen, wird der Schnellkochtopf luftdicht verschlossen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecc1ea9c-b08a-483a-94b3-8592b044bba8",
                                                "sense_id": "28aaf6a3-6f61-352d-a741-3cb65fa916a3",
                                                "text": "„Die blonden Männer machen es sich gemütlich, froh, dass am Wochenende doch keine Großfamilie einfällt und Hammelfleisch in Schnellkochtöpfen mitbringt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d89e6185-4a28-4787-a0c7-e3da23b2e162",
                        "source_entry_id": "33f0f88f-df53-3850-98a2-a4225438b252",
                        "target_lang_word": "pressure cooker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pressure cooker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44b2dfe3-0d0e-3dd6-9a26-e7fe8c35219a",
                                        "entry_id": "d281bed0-7eb8-3ddd-bc02-683e81c2f627",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sealed cooking vessel that allows cooking in greater than atmospheric pressure and at a temperature above the boiling point of water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e202585-8a08-36b4-88b2-b1c73d118b90",
                                        "entry_id": "d281bed0-7eb8-3ddd-bc02-683e81c2f627",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stressful situation that is liable to erupt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "562b3697-13a6-4fe3-91b9-06eee2aa3d34",
                                                "sense_id": "2e202585-8a08-36b4-88b2-b1c73d118b90",
                                                "text": "Look, I had a pressure cooker of a job along with more responsibility that any one person should have. I had an office of twenty-five people under me all needing help like little birds in a nest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b075e5a-140a-47c3-8e67-aba193cb64a3",
                                                "sense_id": "2e202585-8a08-36b4-88b2-b1c73d118b90",
                                                "text": "Wall Street hopes that economic deprivation will turn up the pressure cooker on internal relations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da2ae028-7219-4640-af94-e159428bdc01",
                                                "sense_id": "2e202585-8a08-36b4-88b2-b1c73d118b90",
                                                "text": "Humanity lives in a pressure cooker of stress because of the ruthless way in which we compete, because of our lack of respect for the international rules of commerce, because of social conflicts, because of the devastation to the environment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea30e77b-20b8-4858-b8f0-b8bcd06ed363",
                        "source_entry_id": "33f0f88f-df53-3850-98a2-a4225438b252",
                        "target_lang_word": "autocuiseur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autocuiseur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "986ed681-7e86-3227-a2dc-6730ab10fe34",
                                        "entry_id": "41eb5d9d-baac-31ae-b53d-58f2239e0dd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ustensile de cuisine, récipient hermétiquement clos, cuisant les aliments sous pression, équipé d’une soupape de sécurité qui relâche la vapeur quand la pression dépasse la limite prévue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9deb56c-4e8f-4f6e-9192-c6112b799e64",
                                                "sense_id": "986ed681-7e86-3227-a2dc-6730ab10fe34",
                                                "text": "C'est le revers de la médaille pour le leader français des autocuiseurs ménagers qui, en 1953, a fait le choix de la solidité et de la fiabilité de son produit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eead4f2-f470-42fd-a413-3ce241d7dac2",
                                                "sense_id": "986ed681-7e86-3227-a2dc-6730ab10fe34",
                                                "text": "Les autocuiseurs doivent être munis d'un panier qui assurera une distribution de température plus égale à l'intérieur. La source de chaleur peut être externe (brûleurs de gaz, charbon, bois) ou intégrée (électrique)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5abb3716-4ed7-49db-b869-77441fdff554",
                                                "sense_id": "986ed681-7e86-3227-a2dc-6730ab10fe34",
                                                "text": "Ma pauvre tête menaçait d’éclater, tel un autocuiseur sans soupape jeté dans le cratère d’un volcan en éruption."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
